he \",\"Float\",\" program and Raydium's programs. It helps you build transactions, which you review and sign in your own wallet. We never hold your funds or your keys, can't reverse or cancel a transaction, and don't act as your broker, adviser or agent. How the platform works, including fees and rewards, is described in the\",\" \",[\"$\",\"$Lc\",null,{\"href\":\"/docs\",\"children\":\"Docs\"}],\".\"]}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"children\":\"Risks\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"Coins launched on \",\"Float\",\" are highly speculative and can lose all of their value. Nothing on the site is financial, investment, legal or tax advice, and nothing is a promise of profit. Fee shares, holder rewards and airdrops depend on trading activity, can be small or nothing, and their rules may change. Smart contracts can have bugs, and the \",\"Float\",\" program has not had an outside audit. Blockchains, wallets, RPC providers and third-party services can fail or be delayed. The\",\" \",\"$L14\",\" section of the Docs lists more. Only use money you can afford to lose.\"]}],\"$L15\",\"$L16\",\"$L17\",\"$L18\",\"$L19\",\"$L1a\",\"$L1b\",\"$L1c\",\"$L1d\",\"$L1e\",\"$L1f\",\"$L20\"]}]]}]}],null,\"$L21\"]}],\"p\":\"$@22\",\"v\":\"$23\",\"s\":\"$f\"}}]]\n10:[[\"children\",{\"s\":\"terms\",\"h\":49250,\"d\":{\"r\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$La\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$Lb\",null,{}]}]]}],\"p\":\"$@11\",\"v\":\"$12\",\"s\":\"$f\"},\"c\":\"$Q13\"}]]\n2a:X\n2a:C\n2d:X\n2d:C\n0:{\"t\":{\"t\":{\"s\":\"\",\"h\":49234,\"d\":{\"r\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/32mgl64-f9tu2.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\"}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-0\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1uf15myet59k5.js\",\"async\":true}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-1\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/3ahnuz38hrc3s.js\",\"async\":true}],[\"$\",\"scrip