y third parties (such as xStocks, Sunrise and PreStocks), not by the companies themselves and not by us. Those issuers set their own terms: they can pause, freeze, move or burn their tokens, and some don't offer them in certain countries (xStocks, for example, aren't offered to US persons). A coin is not a share and gives no rights in any company, and \",\"Float\",\" \",\"isn't affiliated with or endorsed by those companies. Coins are created by their creators, not by us, and we don't vet them.\"]}]\n17:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"children\":\"Your responsibilities\"}]\n18:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"You're responsible for your wallet and keys, for checking what you sign, for any taxes, and for following the laws and the token issuers' terms that apply where you live. Don't use the site for anything illegal, including fraud, market manipulation, money laundering or sanctions evasion, and don't launch coins that impersonate people or companies, infringe others' rights, or contain illegal content. We may hide such coins, or anything else, from the site.\"}]\n19:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"children\":\"No warranty, limited liability\"}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"The site and the software are provided \\\"as is\\\" and \\\"as available\\\", without warranties of any kind. To the fullest extent the law allows, the \",\"Float\",\" team is not liable for any loss or damage from using the site, the software or any token, including lost funds, lost profits, or losses caused by bugs, outages, third-party tokens or other users.\"]}]\n1b:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"children\":\"Changes\"}]\n1c:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"We may change the site, the platform's settings or these terms. The date above shows the latest version.\"}]\n1d:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"privacy\",\"children\":\"Privacy\"}]\n1e:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"There are no accounts, and we don't use tracking or advertising cookies. When you connect a wallet, the site reads public on-chain data for its address. Everything you do on chain, including launches, trades and the leaderboard, is public by nature. Images and details you add when launching a coin are uploaded to IPFS through Pinata and are public and permanent. Our hosting provider (Vercel) and the services the site relies on (Helius, Jupiter) process standard request data such as IP addresses to deliver the site. We don't sell personal data.\"}]\n1f:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"children\":\"Contact\"}]\n20:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"Message us on\",\" \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://x.com/floatdotxyz\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noreferrer\",\"children\":\"X\"}],\".\"]}]\n21:[\"$\",\"$L2e\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$9\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@2f\"}]}]\n2c:false\n2f:null\n2b:null\n11:\"$undefined\"\nd:\"$undefined\"\n29:\"$undefined\"\n22:\"$undefined\"\n"
